json5/eigen-string
description: Single-quoted string, or a double-quoted one with the JSON5 extras
- >
  The string spellings JSON5 adds over JSON - single quotes, extra escapes (`\'`, `\x41`, and an
  escaped literal for any other punctuator), and a backslash-escaped line break that lets one
  string span several source lines:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  'it\'s "quoted"'
  "one string \
  on two source lines"
